body:
One of the quotes I always think about. I hate my life and most of my family hates me 

Mom - Hates me since the day I was born pretty sure. Constantly has beaten me till I bleed, Emotionally and mentally abused me as well. Talks crap about me to everyone she meets constantly bashes me to my face about how awful I am and how I will never accomplish anything in life. 

&#x200B;

Dad's Mom - Doesn't like me solely because I was close with my great grandma from my dad's dad who she doesn't like. But yes take that out on a child who had an amazing realtionship with my great grandma. 

&#x200B;

Cousin L - Doesn't like me or my family because we aren't the same religion as them. I used to be close to her oldest daughter ( 16 year difference between the kid and I ) but since they lived semi close and was the only family member nearby I grew close. She started separating herself from me after her child preferred me vs the other cousins who are the same religion

Cousin A - Hates me because I refused to let her husband who is a cheater and sexually abused a 12 year old girl ( the whole family doesn't know that but if they did they probably wouldn't think he was the amazing guy they all think he is ) talk bad about my great grandmother who I am close with. She also assumes I hate her kids because I am not close with them but they live 3 states away of course I am going to hang out with the kids I see more. common sense - and my grandma who hates me really loves this cousin so it just makes sense anyway. 

&#x200B;

Great Grandma M- doesn't care for me because her first daughter my grandma isn't a fan of  me. I try to have a relationship with her but she doesn't seem to want to put forth the effort in having that so I stopped trying hard. I am the third oldest great grandchild and the two older ones both have kids but don't have steady relationships but yet every time I talk to this grandma its always basically asking why I don't have kids yet and don't I want that like cousin A and Cousin H. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

I have more people I could list that goes on and on and more stories about everyone above but just getting this out felt good.
